{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1000_p", "source_sha256": "93f66e2e602ede8552822ea49f18dbbc12877f4e840bd3f7bad2457cd5b099d1", "ja": "（PV撮影の休憩中、百合子が消えてしまった！\nまだ時間はあるけど、心配だから探しに行こう……）", "zh": "（PV拍摄休息时，百合子不见了！\n虽然还有时间，但还是很担心，去找找她吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "c8699b6fcfbfa7dae427ac9631960d3f86c33c891be7b1407f610045d183182c", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1002_p", "source_sha256": "abd6527b7a2c627a0c6086381e867635fe2842442df3d9f38de8b7b5d4d21ffb", "ja": "百合子！　こんなところにいたのか。\nさっきから姿が見えなかったから、探したんだぞ。", "zh": "百合子！原来你在这里啊。\n刚才一直没看到你，我找了你好一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "5e0afe75fb4215ca4510ee7b646bfa5b91cbed31c76d6227b21f854973d323ab", "ja": "ええっ！？　ほ、本当ですか？\nすみません、心配させてしまって……。", "zh": "诶！？真、真的吗？\n对不起，让你担心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1004_p", "source_sha256": "186269f56cf82d8848b64c6a441a451c73deba83b8657ba2fc547229c183aa26", "ja": "いや、見つかってよかったよ。\n何をしていたんだ？", "zh": "不，能找到就好。\n你刚才在做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "1751403d9146d3fdf2cb5978db1a22a01653f6b7919f2550651f80086e4937e8", "ja": "あ、ええと……実はさっき、怪しい横道を\n見つけたんです！　私、ずっと気になっていて。", "zh": "啊，那个……其实刚才我发现了一条可疑的小路！我一直很在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "116492a617a586273f710f0c579a49e247615ee3bb978a2b129f36bf33cc2e93", "ja": "そして気がつくと……まるで何者かに導かれるように、\n私は、その横道へと足を踏み入れていたんです！", "zh": "回过神来……我仿佛被什么人引导着一样，踏入了那条小路！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "0f41891bf639c979def8a2b3f419f5710d39e6fa448a823bb68c236419b725d6", "ja": "でも、その先はただの行き止まりで、\n変わったことは何もなかったんですけど……。", "zh": "可是，走到那边却只是条死路，也没发生什么奇怪的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f24b241c64fbf4b1e864baeb63f69e72f7f215be1764262093306db86eb3c0bb", "ja": "それは残念だったな……って、そうじゃなくて。\nひとりで山道に入るのは、危険だからやめてくれ。", "zh": "那还真是遗憾啊……不对，现在不是说这个的时候。一个人进山路很危险，别这么做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "0e47deba97105a1ed74843dc478010086a3214b74dac4c72d63c304413955cd8", "ja": "ハッ！？　確かにそうですよね。深い森の中、そこに\nどんな魔物が潜んでいるのか、わかりませんもんね。", "zh": "哈！？确实是这样呢。在深邃的森林里，不知道会潜伏着什么样的魔物呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1010_p", "source_sha256": "995a8cf5fb8e26e4e714b50e9f212504f634d755dba8bcaea45ce045e12b082f", "ja": "魔物……はいるかどうかわからないけど、\n神隠しなんて言葉もあるしな。", "zh": "魔物……我倒不知道有没有，不过也有‘神隐’这种说法嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1011_p", "source_sha256": "99c5fababb972cf4c692c6f9848740a05d2c4404048e6c19452e5eb4c08088ae", "ja": "どこかに行くときは一緒に行くから、声を掛けてくれ。\n山を甘く見たらダメだぞ！", "zh": "要去什么地方时就叫上我一起去。\n可不能小看山啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "1c8bbcfa4e4d51c8667e8528d81ef52061ec1b4d6053fb1d5574eab265512cc3", "ja": "わ、わかりました。気をつけます。\nあの、それなら……お願いしてもいいですか？", "zh": "我、我知道了。我会小心的。\n那个……既然这样，可以拜托你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "a3747d2c1629aad8493a4d330a36dd1a1e9769af16010fde698816b41fcc7a1b", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n今日は絶対に、私から目を離さないでください！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n今天请绝对不要把视线从我身上移开！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "77b58c02d6aa85b54bc8ca5f332223f42607c353ccfed5daead81e545adc25ad", "ja": "そうでないと私、どこに行っちゃうか、\n自分でもわからないので……！", "zh": "不然的话，我自己都不知道会飘到哪里去……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "3e685b2be53c469d3193b3cd64ab779157b43674530d2957c77d73bc0fa7ab17", "ja": "今日の演技のせいかもなんですけど、\nなんだか私、ぼんやりしちゃって……。", "zh": "可能是因为今天的演技吧，总觉得我有点恍惚……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a178e1baf4b550bfe35291a39d31367e870c01af0ad3c182d44ecc0815a18153", "ja": "なるほど、そうだったのか……。\nわかった、目を離さないようにするよ。", "zh": "原来如此，是这样啊……\n我明白了，我会一直留意你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "8b151ffe265ee5267396771003bbfeaa1afd892a64704cfe7895ffbd351fd6c8", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}さんが\n見ていてくれるなら、私も安心です！", "zh": "是！只要有{$P$}先生看着，我也就放心了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "dd4f7df35d14e0a043fb5e9fb6bed356fab962df212747d9bff04cac557bfe50", "ja": "もし私が、今度こそ本当に導かれて、不思議な場所へと\n呼ばれるようなことがあっても……。", "zh": "即使这次我真的受到指引，被召唤到某个不可思议的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "16773daae0b9a7e6abd8fcb5ed4d2fe930830c3db467f60d4931cc7a3924376e", "ja": "{$P$}さんと一緒なら、\n何も心配ないですもんね！　えへへ♪", "zh": "只要和{$P$}先生在一起，\n就什么都不用担心了对吧！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0244_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6b4a07dd550e7c7454a6de248bfedac6120924e8439fc33fe34e273afa461ec8", "ja": "（好奇心旺盛なのは、百合子のいいところでもある。\n長所を伸ばせるよう、しっかりと側で見守っていよう）", "zh": "（好奇心旺盛也是百合子的优点。为了让她发挥长处，我要陪在她身边好好守望。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
